  "changes": [
    "Community patch distinguishes only keyring-core Error::NoEntry from failures in sync and async credential reads and deletes; all other read/delete errors use a constant credential-safe message.",
    "macOS cdylib links with a fixed @rpath/libnapi_keyring.dylib install name to prevent private build-path disclosure.",
    "Correct async getter type annotations to reflect actual napi Option::None to null and Vec<u8> to JavaScript number array conversions; no runtime wire change.",
    "Cargo.lock is a new exact dependency resolution, not reconstruction of the upstream npm binary inputs."
  ],
